WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:07,440
Hahaha, Vice President, let me pick this handsome one first.

2
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,300
Move faster

3
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:18,550
Little Mouse, sister gives you two choices.

4
00:00:18,550 --> 00:00:22,750
Either come with me and serve your sister well

5
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:27,550
Either go do odd jobs. I can't guarantee your life or death.

6
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:28,950
I choose odd jobs

7
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:34,860
Okay, then you go clean the playground machine

8
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:38,090
Can't finish it in two hours

9
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:41,090
Everything becomes part of sharpening the sword

10
00:00:41,090 --> 00:00:43,090
I saw you as soon as you came in.

11
00:00:43,090 --> 00:00:44,690
It can't be cleared at all. It's because of regulations.

12
00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:48,300
This guy is dead. He'll get the fate of a tough talker.

13
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:52,100
Everyone takes action. The task cannot be completed.

14
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,700
Just die
